<h2 id="1-what-is-__attribute__">1. What is <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">__attribute__</code></h2>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">__attribute__</code> is a language extension introduced by GCC, and LLVM/Clang is fully compatible with it and extends it heavily. It allows developers to pass additional semantic information to the compiler, affecting code generation, optimization, warnings, and runtime behavior.</p>

