<h2 id="2-beforeafter-function-calls-constructor--destructor--cleanup">2. Before/After Function Calls: constructor / destructor / cleanup</h2>

<p>This is the most easily overlooked but very powerful group of attributes — they let code run automatically before/after <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">main()</code>, or when a variable leaves its scope.</p>

